<title>BELGIUM: TABLE-Belgian tax receipts up 5.7 pct in H1 1997.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Belgian tax receipts up 5.7 pct in H1 1997.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total Belgian fiscal receipts were up 6.9 percent in June from June 1996 and up 5.7 percent in the first six months of 1997 from the same 1996 period, the Finance Ministry said in a statement on Thursday.  </p>
<p>TAX RECEIPTS (in million bfr)</p>
<p>				     June 97	June 96    pct change</p>
<p>    Total			  197,099	184,331	6.9</p>
<p>    Direct taxation	    115,327	130,794    -11.8</p>
<p>    V.A.T and similar taxes   45,782	 45,122	1.5</p>
<p>CUMULATIVE TAX RECEIPTS (in million bfr)</p>
<p>				     Jan-Jun 97   Jan-Jun 96 pct change</p>
<p>    Total			  1,158,194    1,095,478    5.7</p>
<p>    Direct taxation		686,988	644,695    6.6</p>
<p>    V.A.T and similar taxes    283,862	273,315    3.9</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
